{"id":"5ad0eaad0b","t":"Isekai Yururi Kikou: Kosodateshinagara Boukensha Shimasu","c":"aq:/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/Isekai.jpg","n":16,"l":16,"s":["aq"],"k":{"aq":"isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu"},"u":1795036067090,"desc":"『أنا متأسف للغاية』 فجأة ظهر إله يسجد متأسفًا أمام كايانو تاكومي، والذي قتل بالخطأ كما يبدو. وفوق ذلك، ليس بمقدرته أن يُولد مجددًا. لكن، يمكنه العيش في عالم ثانٍ؟ إذن، أرجو أن نقوم بذلك. الإله أخطأ مجددًا وأرسلني إلى غابةٍ خطرة. ما الذي يحدث بجد؟ إضافة لذلك، هنالك أطفالٌ هنا. لا يمكنني تركهم هنا، سأعتني بهم.","type":"مانجا","status":"مستمرة","genres":["أكشن","خيال","شونين","مغامرة"],"src":{"aq":"isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu"},"chapters":{"1":{"aq":"isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu|/manga/isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu/1/"},"2":{"aq":"isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu|/manga/isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu/2/"},"3":{"aq":"isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu|/manga/isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu/3/"},"4":{"aq":"isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu|/manga/isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu/4/"},"5":{"aq":"isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu|/manga/isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu/5/"},"6":{"aq":"isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu|/manga/isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu/6/"},"7":{"aq":"isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu|/manga/isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu/7/"},"8":{"aq":"isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu|/manga/isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu/8/"},"9":{"aq":"isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu|/manga/isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu/9/"},"10":{"aq":"isekai-yururi-kikou-kosodateshinagara-boukensha-shimasu